      <title>德基艺术奥莱为Max Mara清货搭台阶 消费者却只顾打卡新厕所</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260904/%E5%BE%B7%E5%9F%BA%E8%89%BA%E6%9C%AF%E5%A5%A5%E8%8E%B1%E4%B8%BAMax-Mara%E6%B8%85%E8%B4%A7%E6%90%AD%E5%8F%B0%E9%98%B6-%E6%B6%88%E8%B4%B9%E8%80%85%E5%8D%B4%E5%8F%AA%E9%A1%BE%E6%89%93%E5%8D%A1%E6%96%B0%E5%8E%95%E6%89%80/</link>
